#: cuda.tile._stub.ArrayAnnotation:20 of
msgid ""
"Stride dimensions to specialize to their launch-time values, making them "
"compile-time constants inside the kernel. This is the sole source of "
"static strides for the array: once any dimension is listed, the "
"dispatcher stops inferring ``stride == 1`` for *every* dimension of it, "
"so list the contiguous dimension explicitly to keep it a compile-time "
"constant."
msgstr ""
"需要按启动时取值进行特化的步长维度列表，从而使这些步长在内核内部成为编译期常量。这是数组静态步长的唯一来源：一旦列出了任意维度，分发器就会停止为该数组的"
" *任何* 维度自动推断 ``stride == 1`` ，因此若需保留连续维度为编译期常量，请将其显式列出。"

