msgstr "标量注解"

#: ../../../docstring of
#: typing.Annotated:1
msgid "A type hint indicating that a scalar integer parameter uses int64."
msgstr "指示标量整数参数使用 int64 的类型提示。"

#: ../../../docstring of
#: typing.Annotated:3
msgid ""
"By default, integer kernel parameters are inferred as int32. Use this "
"annotation to force int64 inference for parameters that need the wider "
"range."
msgstr "默认情况下，整数内核参数会被推断为 int32。对于需要更大数值范围的参数，可使用此注解强制将其推断为 int64。"

